1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
@ChangleAirportScene{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=establish|shot=establish|kind=action}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}

2
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:07,200
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=guide_wave|shot=wide|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Yuki]哈喽哈喽！小雪的游记频道开播啦——今天带你们逛福州长乐机场 T2 航站楼！

3
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:11,906
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=beg|shot=cat|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Mochi]纠正一下，是我们。朕的出场费结一下。

4
00:00:11,946 --> 00:00:28,327
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=point_up|shot=roof|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Yuki]你看这个屋顶，一道一道的弧线叫马鞍墙，是福州古厝的经典造型。T2 的设计来头可不小——当年国际竞赛的第一名，是设计了新加坡樟宜机场的 CPG 和中国建筑设计研究院的联合体，落地深化由北京建院完成！

5
00:00:28,367 --> 00:00:33,627
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=cat_climb|shot=cat|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Mochi]翻译一下：超大号猫爬架，而且不让爬。

6
00:00:33,667 --> 00:00:40,918
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=point_up2|shot=ceiling|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Yuki]抬头看！天花板上这些树叶一样的大屏幕，在循环放福州的宣传片——茉莉花都开到天上去啦！

7
00:00:40,958 --> 00:00:45,239
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=cat_kiosk|shot=cat|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Mochi]等它开始播小鱼干广告，朕再抬头。

8
00:00:45,279 --> 00:00:50,585
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=sea_point|shot=sea|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Yuki]这边落地窗外面就是大海！二十五万五千平方米的航站楼，直接建在海边！

9
00:00:50,625 --> 00:00:55,267
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=sea_listen|shot=sea|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Mochi]海里有鱼。鱼会晒成干。逻辑闭环，朕悟了。

10
00:00:55,307 --> 00:00:58,667
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=gtc_ask|shot=gtc|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Mochi]窗户外面那个大工地，是什么？

11
00:00:58,707 --> 00:01:04,737
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=gtc_tell|shot=gtc|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Yuki]那是 GTC 综合交通中心！以后高铁和地铁直接开进机场，跟航站楼连在一起！

12
00:01:04,777 --> 00:01:08,670
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=gtc_punch|shot=gtc|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Mochi]哦。小鱼干的冷链直通车。

13
00:01:08,710 --> 00:01:13,797
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=checkin_push|shot=checkin|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Yuki]值机柜台是零高差的，行李箱轻轻一推就滑进去，托运不用练举重！

14
00:01:13,837 --> 00:01:19,850
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=checkin_idle|shot=checkin|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Mochi]请问托运一只猫走哪个通道？朕自带体检报告。

15
00:01:19,890 --> 00:01:24,120
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=seat_usb|shot=seat|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Yuki]候机座椅每一个都有 USB 接口，全楼还有 WiFi7！

16
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:30,722
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=seat_talk|shot=seat|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Mochi]朕的手机只剩百分之一的电。别问，问就是看了一路猫片。

17
00:01:30,762 --> 00:01:34,779
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=explain|shot=restroom|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Yuki]最绝的是洗手间——马桶圈是指纹感应、自动换垫的！

18
00:01:34,819 --> 00:01:40,244
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=press_watch|shot=pad|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Mochi]朕按了爪印。识别成功，尊享喵星贵宾座。

19
00:01:40,284 --> 00:01:47,151
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=finale_proud|shot=wide|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Yuki]一年三千六百万人次的吞吐量，4F 级的大机场，九月十六号刚刚启用，我们算第一批游客啦！

20
00:01:47,191 --> 00:01:51,313
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=peek|shot=cat|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Mochi]导游小姐，纪念品商店有小鱼干吗？

21
00:01:51,353 --> 00:01:53,590
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=speechless|shot=yuki|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Yuki]……你是来参观的，还是来进货的？

22
00:01:53,630 --> 00:01:57,362
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=smug|shot=cat|kind=dialogue}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[Mochi]参观是工作，进货是生活。

23
00:01:57,402 --> 00:02:03,633
{Event:Animate|character=Yuki|action=ReachOut|move=outro|shot=pullback|kind=voiceover}{Camera:Static|position=0.2,1.7,5.6|lookAt=-0.1,1.0,-0.4}[PA]女士们先生们，欢迎来到福州长乐国际机场 T2 航站楼。
